   "driving": {
    "id": "driving",
    "text": "Something in the deep wood. The deer are thin, the Pack's thinner, and the old alpha, Greymuzzle, has brought them closer to people than he ever would. Find out why and you'll have done more than a hundred pelts. Ask Tam, by the well. He's seen something, and nobody believes a child.",
    "effects": [
     {
      "quest": {
       "id": "beasts",
       "entry": "maeca_theory"
      }
     }
    ],
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "tracks": {
    "id": "tracks",
    "text": "You saw that? Nobody sees that. Dragging, yes. Weak in the hindquarters, like a dog that's eaten what it shouldn't. So. Not bold. Sick.",
    "effects": [
     {
      "rel": {
       "npc": "maeca",
       "respect": 20,
       "trust": 10
      }
     },
     {
      "learn": "clue.sick_wolf",
      "text": "The wolves are sick, not bold."
     },
     {
      "quest": {
       "id": "beasts",
       "entry": "clue.sick_wolf"
      }
     }
    ],
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "truth": {
    "id": "truth",
    "text": "Grimtunnel's diggers. Should've known; every bad thing under Thornhollow has a lamp in its hand. Stop that pump and the Pack'll come back to itself. Days, maybe. It'll happen.",
    "effects": [
     {
      "rel": {
       "npc": "maeca",
       "respect": 20,
       "trust": 15
      }
     }
    ],
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "speak": {
    "id": "speak",
    "text": "Not with words. But Greymuzzle's old and he isn't stupid. Go into the Hollow with no wolf blood on you, none since you last slept. Don't wear their skins. And don't run. He'll decide what you are. If he decides wrong, well. Run then.",
    "effects": [
     {
      "learn": "hint.greymuzzle"
     }
    ],
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "where": {
    "id": "where",
    "text": "The Hunters' Blind, out past the wreck on the Old Road, most days. I watch the Hollow from there. You'll know it by the smoke; I'm the only one fool enough to light a fire in that wood. Nights, I'm here, drinking Rav's piss.",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "barefoot": {
    "id": "barefoot",
    "text": "Boots were signed for. They never came. You learn to hear the ground through your feet. I prefer it now.",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Who signed for them?",
      "goto": "signed"
     },
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     }
    ]
   },
   "signed": {
    "id": "signed",
    "text": "Somebody with a good hand and a ledger. ...You ask a lot of questions for a stranger.",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Something else.",
      "goto": "hub"
     },
     {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "thanks": {
    "id": "thanks",
    "text": "The Hollow's quiet. The Pack's eating again: deer, not travellers. I've been a hunter all my life, {name}, and I've never once saved anything. ...Thank you.",
