   "blood": {
    "id": "blood",
    "text": "(At the edge of the Hollow she stops, and sniffs, once, and turns round.) Not with that on you. Wash. River's that way. ...Or sleep, and come tomorrow. The night takes it off. It took it off me.",
    "choices": [
