      "text": "...",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "blind_walk": {
    "id": "blind_walk",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": [
     {
      "when": {
       "not": {
        "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
        "gte": 1
       }
      },
      "text": "She goes out by the east gate without a lamp, and you follow her along the Old Road past the wreck, by starlight and the white of the frost. She walks barefoot on ground that would cut you through your boots, and doesn't make a sound. Once she stops, and you stop, and somewhere off in the Hollow a wolf calls and is answered. \"Him,\" she says. \"And the bitch with the torn ear. Eating.\" She walks on."
     },
     {
      "text": "The Old Road, the wreck, the frost. You know the way now, and she lets you walk in front, which she has never done."
     }
    ],
    "next": "blind_fire"
   },
   "blind_fire": {
    "id": "blind_fire",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "The Hunters' Blind is a lean-to of hides against a fallen oak, with a fire the size of a hat. She feeds it one stick at a time. She doesn't talk. After a while she takes the crossbow off her back, and checks it, and lays it down by her right hand, and turns and looks at you across the fire as if you were a track she has been following for days.",
    "next": "blind_ask"
   },
   "blind_ask": {
    "id": "blind_ask",
    "text": [
     {
      "when": {
       "not": {
        "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
        "gte": 1
       }
      },
      "text": "If you're going to talk after, don't."
     },
     {
      "text": "(She holds out her hand. That's all.)"
     }
    ],
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "I won't.",
      "show": {
       "not": {
        "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
        "gte": 1
       }
      },
      "goto": "blind"
     },
     {
      "text": "(Take her hand.)",
      "show": {
       "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
       "gte": 1
      },
      "goto": "blind"
     },
     {
      "text": "Then not tonight. I'll keep the fire.",
      "goto": "watch_only"
     },
     {
      "text": "(Stop here. Go back to town.)",
      "goto": "blind_leave"
     }
    ]
   },
   "blind_leave": {
    "id": "blind_leave",
    "text": "(She nods at the fire.) Mind the frost on the Old Road. It's worse by the wreck.",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Goodnight.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "watch_only": {
    "id": "watch_only",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": "You keep the fire. She keeps the dark. Some time after midnight she comes in from the edge of the light and sits down with her back against yours, and you can feel her breathing, slow, and listening. You sleep like that, sitting up. In the morning the frost is on both your shoulders and not between them.",
    "effects": [
     {
      "rel": {
       "npc": "maeca",
       "trust": 10,
       "affection": 5
      },
      "quiet": true
     },
     {
      "condition": {
       "id": "rested",
       "days": 1,
       "note": "A night keeping Maeca's fire"
      }
     }
    ],
    "next": "watch_morning"
   },
   "watch_morning": {
    "id": "watch_morning",
    "text": "You kept quiet. (She stands, and stretches, and looks at the Hollow, not you.) Most can't.",
    "choices": [
     {
      "text": "Morning.",
      "end": true
     }
    ]
   },
   "blind_dark": {
    "id": "blind_dark",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "text": [
     {
      "when": {
       "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
       "eq": 2
      },
      "text": "Afterwards, in the dark under the hides, she puts her feet against your legs, and you flinch: they're cold as stones in a stream. She starts to take them back."
     },
     {
      "when": {
       "all": [
        {
         "all": [
          {
           "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
           "gte": 3
          },
          {
           "not": {
            "npcFlag": {
             "npc": "maeca",
             "key": "say:asked",
             "eq": true
            }
           }
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "fact": "beasts.outcome",
         "eq": "allied"
        }
       ]
      },
      "text": "Later, with the fire down, she lies with her head on your chest, listening the way she listens to the Hollow. Outside, in the frost, you hear them come: soft feet, a long way round, and then a sigh, and then another. The Pack, lying down round the Blind in the dark. She lifts her head. \"They don't do that,\" she says. \"Not for me. Not for anyone.\" She lies back down. \"You walk quiet. You came into my Hollow and knelt to him and he let you. You never talk about before.\" A pause. \"What were you?\""
     },
     {
      "when": {
       "all": [
        {
         "fact": "maeca.blind_nights",
         "gte": 3
        },
        {
         "not": {
          "npcFlag": {
           "npc": "maeca",
           "key": "say:asked",
           "eq": true
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      },
      "text": "Later, with the fire down, she lies with her head on your chest, listening the way she listens to the Hollow. \"You walk quiet,\" she says. \"You never talk about before.\" A pause. \"What were you?\""
     },
     {
      "text": "The fire's down to embers. Far off, the Pack is quiet."
     }
    ],
