      "when": {
       "fact": "sella.free",
       "eq": true
      },
      "text": "You go up Sella's stairs. (She doesn't look up from her cup.) Not for money, now. Rook talks. ...Is it her, or me, or both? I don't mind which. I mind not knowing."
     },
     {
      "text": "You go up Sella's stairs. Rook talks. (A shrug.) She's honest about what she charges. That's more than most."
     }
    ],
    "effects": [
